  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1203.30 Medical equipment manufacturing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1203.30 “Medical equipment manufacturing” means the manufacture of medical devices including, but not limited to, catheters, heart valves, blood cardioplegia machines, tracheostomy tubes, blood oxygenators, and cardiatory reservoirs.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
